  "limitations": [
    "AUTHORED: every parapet, tank, collector, condenser, dish, aerial, washing line, stair house, dome, awning, vault and stall placed here is invented massing in the style of the modern city. Only the stone ordinance and the ubiquity of solar water heating are sourced claims; nothing else is surveyed, photogrammetric or a claim about a particular building. Nothing here is halachic.",
